{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>So righteousness</b> — as the reward of righteousness is truth, so righteousness is for the sake of life that one attains through it, and they are the life of the soul." "<b>And pursues</b> — a verb going out to the heart, or to another, and likewise it is a commandment to pursue, because of his death that he die before his time."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:10.655836611Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}